{"availability":"available","full":"buildingopen/openpage","name":"openpage","description":"Open-source website builder with visual drag-and-drop editor, AI site generation, and JSON-first architecture. Self-hosted alternative to Framer, Lovable, v0. React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":93,"forks":40,"created":"2026-02-26T14:46:05Z","updated":"2026-03-07T17:26:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://openpage-phi.vercel.app","topics":["ai","ai-website-generator","drag-and-drop","framer-alternative","headless","json-config","landing-page","landing-page-builder","no-code","nocode","open-source","page-builder","react","self-hosted","tailwindcss","typescript","visual-editor","vite","website-builder"],"demo":"https://openpage-phi.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:15.966Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:15.966Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:15.966Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:15.966Z","stars":93,"forks":40}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["OpenPage is an open-source website builder that uses JSON as the single source of truth. It combines a Framer-like visual drag-and-drop editor with AI-powered site generation, producing websites that are fully described by a structured, typed JSON config. Unlike code generators (Lovable, v0, Bolt) that produce fragile output, or visual editors (Framer, Webflow) that lock you into proprietary formats, OpenPage gives both humans and AI agents a shared, predictable interface to build and edit websites.","Live Demo · Quick Start · Blocks · API · Themes · FAQ","Code generation is fragile: LLMs hallucinate imports, break builds, produce unmergeable diffs. Visual editors lock you into proprietary formats that AI agents can't read or edit programmatically."],"features":["Visual drag-and-drop editor with real-time preview, block reordering, and inline editing","AI website generation from a text prompt via Gemini (POST a prompt, get back a complete site)","19 block types, 42 layout variants covering navbars, heroes, features, pricing, testimonials, FAQs, and more","10 built-in theme presets with full customization (colors, fonts, border radius, spacing)","One-click HTML export producing a standalone, self-contained file with zero runtime dependencies"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/buildingopen/openpage/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"f638d9cd8744d4bb5dea58830d68dc9ada6d256b10530f32e7a64e62bd16ed27","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:16.127Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:16.127Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"OpenPage is an open-source website builder that uses JSON as the single source of truth. It combines a Framer-like visual drag-and-drop editor with AI-powered site generation, producing websites that are fully described by a structured, typed JSON config. Unlike code generators (Lovable, v0, Bolt) that produce fragile output, or visual editors (Framer, Webflow) that lock you into proprietary formats, OpenPage gives both humans and AI agents a shared, predictable interface to build and edit websites.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/buildingopen/openpage/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f638d9cd8744d4bb5dea58830d68dc9ada6d256b10530f32e7a64e62bd16ed27","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/buildingopen/openpage/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:16.127Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-03-07T17:26:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/buildingopen/openpage/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:16.128Z","hash":"f638d9cd8744d4bb5dea58830d68dc9ada6d256b10530f32e7a64e62bd16ed27","originalBytes":14852,"storedBytes":14852,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["json","openpage","api","visual","website","site","code","prompt","editor","blocks","structured","theme","block","build","every","gen